WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.402
I said it.
I said it right there.

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:03.436
I was like,
"You a woman."

00:00:03.469 --> 00:00:04.637
- Mm-hmm.
- "I'm a man."

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:06.039
- Mm-hmm.
- There's a difference--

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:07.440 line:92%
Oh, what?

00:00:07.473 --> 00:00:08.808
They bumpin' niggas
up in here.

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:10.076
Here it is.
It's going off.

00:00:10.109 --> 00:00:13.579
Yo!
Hey!

00:00:13.612 --> 00:00:18.084
Which one of y'all
motherfuckers...

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:19.419 line:92%
bumped me?

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:21.120 line:92%
I did.

00:00:21.153 --> 00:00:24.057
What the fuck you gonna do
about it?

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.358 line:92%
What's up?

00:00:28.494 --> 00:00:31.297
Oh, I'll tell you
what I'ma do about it!

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:32.532
You don't want
to do this today.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:33.633
Ooh, yeah.
Yeah, what?

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:35.168
You lucky my friend's
holding me.

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:36.736
You lucky,
'cause I'll tear your head off!

00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:38.838
Don't hold me back, dude!
Don't hold me back!

00:00:38.871 --> 00:00:40.440
Oh, okay.
Then go for it.

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:48.181 line:92%
See, I know, though,

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:50.283
if I were to lunge
at you right now,

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:52.285
my friend right here--
he'd catch me

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:53.686
at the last
possible second--

00:00:53.719 --> 00:00:55.522
No, no,
no, I won't.

00:01:02.161 --> 00:01:05.531
But my friend does have
the cognizance

00:01:05.564 --> 00:01:08.534
to tell me I don't need
to be going up

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:11.471
and committing capital murder
up in a club tonight.

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:13.106
Oh, no, just knock him
unconscious, dog.

00:01:13.139 --> 00:01:15.541 line:92%
Bam!

00:01:15.574 --> 00:01:16.776
You don't have
to kill anybody.

00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:20.313
I mean, no need for that.
That's excessive.

00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:22.381 line:92%
Tear him up.

00:01:22.414 --> 00:01:24.317 line:92%
I will, but--

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:28.221
[stammering]
Wait. Let me finish my sentence.

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:30.557 line:92%
I will, uh...

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:34.861 line:92%
Oh!

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:37.897
Oh, snap.
You know what?

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:40.466
You lucky my boy's using
his telekinetic powers

00:01:40.499 --> 00:01:42.135
to hold me back
right now.

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:43.669 line:92%
No, I'm not.

00:01:43.702 --> 00:01:48.341
Well, maybe it's the type
of telekinesis

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:51.878
that's a mutant power that you
didn't realize you had

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:54.413 line:92%
until the moment it--

00:01:54.446 --> 00:01:55.748 line:92%
Oh, oh!

00:01:55.781 --> 00:01:57.350
I got it.
I see, I see.

00:01:57.383 --> 00:01:58.551
So you want me
to hold you back.

00:01:58.584 --> 00:01:59.652 line:92%
Nigga...

00:01:59.685 --> 00:02:01.487 line:92%
[screaming]

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:02.922 line:92%
I'm a dragon.

00:02:02.955 --> 00:02:04.390
Oh, yeah,
I want to rip this.

00:02:04.423 --> 00:02:06.592
I'm a lion.
I'm a tiger over here.

00:02:06.625 --> 00:02:08.494
I'm a bear.
Oh, my.

00:02:08.527 --> 00:02:09.762
I'll go crazy
on you.

00:02:09.795 --> 00:02:11.364 line:92%
Oh, I can't believe it.

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:12.698
The man--he's like a tornado
up in here.

00:02:12.731 --> 00:02:14.300 line:92%
Don't hold me back.

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:15.668
I can't even believe
I can hold him back.

00:02:15.701 --> 00:02:16.669 line:92%
Do it, man!

00:02:16.702 --> 00:02:17.770
I can't believe
I'm this strong!

00:02:17.803 --> 00:02:19.438
Let me go!
Let me go!

00:02:19.471 --> 00:02:21.507
I'm one-arming it.
I can't believe I'm this strong.

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:22.542 line:92%
Let me go!

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:23.876
I'ma hold him back
with one finger.

00:02:23.909 --> 00:02:25.478
He's like a little baby.
He can't get past me.

00:02:25.511 --> 00:02:26.879
He's like a little--Ow!
What?

00:02:26.912 --> 00:02:29.749
- I'm a little baby?
- I'm holding you back, man!

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:31.217
- You're stupid, man!
- I know.

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:32.451
I got carried away.
I apologize.

00:02:32.484 --> 00:02:33.853
What you mean
you got carried away?

00:02:33.886 --> 00:02:35.855
You told me to hold you back.
I was holding you back.

00:02:35.888 --> 00:02:36.956
What do you
want me to do?

00:02:36.989 --> 00:02:38.291
In a fight situation,
no means no,

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:39.292 line:92%
and yes means yes.

00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:40.693
How would
I have known that?

00:02:40.726 --> 00:02:41.928
Oh, wait.
Come on, man, ow.

00:02:41.961 --> 00:02:43.396 line:92%
Come on, that hurt.

00:02:43.429 --> 00:02:44.497
And you holding me
back now?

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:46.332
Thank you
very much for that.

00:02:46.365 --> 00:02:48.634
Okay, well,
just at least change it up.

00:02:48.667 --> 00:02:49.169
Okay, now
you listen.

